Z||000006||FieroBUZZ||04-05-2001||11:01 PM||||Your 84 is prob code M19 (4:10 final 3.53 first) and if the V6 is Code M17 (3.65 final, 3.53 first) otherwise they should be the same strength wise (Muncies)<BR>Gary<p>[This message has been edited by FieroBUZZ (edited 04-05-2001).]||||reg||1
